<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style=""><div>Hello [client]<br><br></div><div>There may come a time when you will need to report a job-related accident or injury. I wanted you to have the information you need in advance of any unfortunate situation. The following steps should be taken to report the injury and begin a Workers Compensation claim. Please reach out if you have questions about this process.<br><br></div><div><b>Reporting a Job-Related Accident or Injury</b></div><div><ul><li><b>Report all injuries to Sedgwick at 866-863-6522 within 24 hours</b> to avoid state-assessed fines.</li><li><b>Report fatalities immediately</b> to Sedgwick at 866-863-5622, Insperity at 281-348-3930 and OSHA at 1-800=321-6742 within 8 hours.&nbsp;</li><li><b>Report severe injuries</b> (in-patient hospitalization, amputation, or eye loss) within 24 hours.</li></ul></div><div><b>Steps for reporting a claim:</b></div><div><ol><li>Determine if your state has any specific requirements. If you are located in North Dakota, Ohio, Washington, or Wyoming, you are located in a monopolistic state. If you are in Minnesota or Tennessee, you must follow specific requirements. To review these requirements, please visit <a href="https://portal.insperity.com/pcms/reporting_a_jobrelated_accident_or_injury">this page</a>.&nbsp;<br><br></li><li>Fill out the <a href="https://portal.insperity.com/pcms/documents/20230413220749248">First Report of Injury Workers Compensation Notification</a> (attached above)<br><br></li><li>Choose one of the following reporting methods:For additional information on OSHA reporting <a href="https://www.osha.gov/report">click here</a>.<br><br><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt=""></li></ol></div><div>For assistance in finding a Workers Comp Provider, <a href="https://www.goperspecta.com/VPD/insperity/public/ProviderSearch/Main">click here</a>.<br><br></div><div>You are welcome to connect directly with Insperity's Workers Compensation team at <a href="mailto:workerscompclaims@insperity.com">workerscompclaims@insperity.com</a> with specific questions.<br><br></div><div>Thank you,<br><br></div><div><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[signature]</span></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>